      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“虽然不急，但我会一直等着喔！”\n“能不能和奇锐骏跑一场啊。”\n“重现那场东京大赏典的盛况吧！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf81e637ea0f03d86b0145dcdea3ba9d0ef37d011b928b1babcecd9c341cade5",
